<h2>Privacy</h2>
<p>{{ business }} collects as little as possible, and this page says exactly
what and why. If anything here is unclear, ask us at
<a href="mailto:{{ email }}">{{ email }}</a>.</p>

<h3>What we hold</h3>
<p>If you buy something: your name, email address{% if sells_physical %}, and the
delivery address you give at checkout{% endif %}, along with what you bought and
when. We keep this because we have to &mdash; it is the record of a sale, and tax
rules require us to keep it{% if retention_years %} for {{ retention_years }} years{% endif %}.</p>
<p>If you send us a message through this site: your name, email address and what
you wrote, so we can reply.</p>
{% if sells_services %}
<p>If you book a session: the time you booked and the email address the
confirmation goes to.</p>
{% endif %}
<p>We never see your card details. They go straight to our payment provider and
never reach this website.</p>

<h3>Who else is involved</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Stripe</strong> takes the payment and holds the record of it.</li>
  {% if sells_services %}<li><strong>Cal.com</strong> holds your booking and sends the confirmation.</li>{% endif %}
  <li><strong>Our email provider</strong> carries the messages we send you.</li>
</ul>
<p>Each of them only gets what they need to do that job. We do not sell your
details to anyone, and we do not use them for advertising.</p>

<h3>Cookies</h3>
<p>This site sets a cookie to remember what is in your basket, and one to keep
the site owner signed in. Neither follows you anywhere else, and there is no
tracking or advertising cookie on this site.</p>

<h3>What you can ask for</h3>
<p>You can ask what we hold about you, ask for a copy, ask us to correct it, or
ask us to delete it. Email <a href="mailto:{{ email }}">{{ email }}</a> and we
will answer within a month. We may have to keep sale records even after a
deletion request, because tax law says so &mdash; we will tell you if that
applies.</p>
{% if in_eu or in_ch %}
<p>If you think we have handled your information badly, you can complain to
{% if in_ch %}the Federal Data Protection and Information Commissioner (edoeb.admin.ch){% else %}
your national data protection authority{% endif %}.</p>
{% endif %}
